Package: bootei
Title: Bootstrap Ensemble Tie-Breaking for Permutation Tests
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Giovanni", "Corradini", 
           email = "giovanni.corradini.giovanni@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    Provides BOOTEI (Bootstrap Ensemble Inference), a drop-in refinement of
    classical Monte Carlo permutation tests for discrete test statistics.
    The method preserves finite-sample validity and the interpretation of
    permutation p-values, while resolving ties via a coupled bootstrap
    ensemble layer. BOOTEI pointwise dominates the standard add-one
    permutation p-value and coincides with it when ties are absent.
